8974834_959141252247740_917842555609860014_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bIrMbL9le7IQ7kNvwE-RJve&_nc_oc=AdpRYjN7lqglo5oN_moKef2ZW4CJZAlDO8e2E5JanWUQ4g0iZ-AnWEXiTIEKdzB7B30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0RouC6daOyKK6dW_dGuy0ckKswBa_BsaQMWZ6hoVbMGA&oe=69EE0C8D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Velocity Car Driving/Drift Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\ude97 Velocity Car Driving Simulator - A Tranquil Driving Adventure!\n\nImmerse yourself in the art of driving with Velocity Car Driving Simulator. Unlike traditional racing games, our simulator focuses on delivering a serene and realistic driving experience that allows you to appreciate the beauty of the road.\n\n\ud83c\udf04 Key Features:\n\n\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Dynamic Environments: Cruise through meticulously designed landscapes and cityscapes.\n\ud83d\ude97 Realistic Driving Physics: Experience lifelike driving physics for a true-to-life sensation.\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open-World Exploration: Explore vast open worlds with endless driving possibilities.\n\ud83c\udf05 Day and Night Transitions: Witness the changing landscapes and city lights as you drive through different times of the day.\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Intuitive Controls: Enjoy easy-to-use controls designed for a relaxing and immersive driving experience.\n\ud83d\ude99 Customization and Relaxation:\nVelocity Car Driving Simulator lets you customize your driving experience. Relax, unwind, and enjoy the therapeutic nature of our driving simulator.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f Download now and embark on a tranquil driving journey!\n\nEscape the hustle and bustle of racing and embrace the calm beauty of the road with Velocity Car Driving Simulator.", "short_description": "Explore, drive, and relax in Velocity Car Driving/Drift Simulator."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xzsol.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_u